Package: rawproject
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: awesomeshot5051 englandtechnologies@gmail.com
Depends: bash, openssh-client
Recommends: btrfs-progs, snapper
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Raw-footage project folders on a file server or local btrfs disk
 rawproject creates, finishes and lists raw-footage project folders on a
 file server over ssh, or on a local btrfs disk with snapper snapshots.
